{"3813780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Aeoliada", "steam_appid": 3813780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/37d86a50cd4d01321ab79d11b05377ba.avif?t=1778387369\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/e8ecedd4e44641bec4e6c9a148f643f6.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🌟Precision-Driven Rhythm Combat Experience🌟</strong>  <br> <br>Take on the journey of a demigoddess queen to reclaim her lost divinity. Every strike, block, and dodge resonates with the rhythm of the battlefield. Rhythm is not just the rule, but the power that brings you victory. <br> <br><strong>⚔️Smooth Melee Combos Deeply Integrated with Rhythm Mechanics⚔️</strong> <br> <br>Freely switch between katana, greatsword, dual blades, and pistols, unleashing abilities synchronized with the rhythm, coordinating tactics with your companions, and achieving a delicate balance between high-speed pressure and satisfying controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/a1a8e0febb8764e13294bc96afc5ef8e.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><strong>🕹️Clear and Direct Core Gameplay🕹️</strong>  <br> <br> Advance the main storyline, hone your combat and magic skills, unlock new abilities, fight alongside your characters, and deepen your bonds through battles and mini-games. Finally, step into the final challenge and face the immortal Celestial Guard - Galactrion.  <br> <br>Follow Queen Eudoxia, the last scion of a fading god-bloodline, as she battles to reclaim her dynasty's divine legacy in a world where mortality is a curse and immortality a forbidden dream. <br><br><strong>🌟For what has died shall rise again.🌟</strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/19ea741f04f778fcd6d9f3a94ff64cc0.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1778387369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras_big/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1778387369 width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><br><br><strong></strong><br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/37d86a50cd4d01321ab79d11b05377ba.avif?t=1778387369\" width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/e8ecedd4e44641bec4e6c9a148f643f6.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>🌟Precision-Driven Rhythm Combat Experience🌟</strong>  <br> <br>Take on the journey of a demigoddess queen to reclaim her lost divinity. Every strike, block, and dodge resonates with the rhythm of the battlefield. Rhythm is not just the rule, but the power that brings you victory. <br> <br><strong>⚔️Smooth Melee Combos Deeply Integrated with Rhythm Mechanics⚔️</strong> <br> <br>Freely switch between katana, greatsword, dual blades, and pistols, unleashing abilities synchronized with the rhythm, coordinating tactics with your companions, and achieving a delicate balance between high-speed pressure and satisfying controls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/a1a8e0febb8764e13294bc96afc5ef8e.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><br><strong>🕹️Clear and Direct Core Gameplay🕹️</strong>  <br> <br> Advance the main storyline, hone your combat and magic skills, unlock new abilities, fight alongside your characters, and deepen your bonds through battles and mini-games. Finally, step into the final challenge and face the immortal Celestial Guard - Galactrion.  <br> <br>Follow Queen Eudoxia, the last scion of a fading god-bloodline, as she battles to reclaim her dynasty's divine legacy in a world where mortality is a curse and immortality a forbidden dream. <br><br><strong>🌟For what has died shall rise again.🌟</strong> <br> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/19ea741f04f778fcd6d9f3a94ff64cc0.avif?t=1778387369\" width=1560 height=878 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1778387369\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3813780/extras_big/6933f192cf6d77c2c7763a76843e26fe.avif?t=1778387369 width=800 height=618 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "3D Action RPG about a demigoddess queen cancelling her enemies with high kicks, a katana and a greatsword, in a mix of Hack &amp; Slash combat wit